ative formula was crafted to take your collagen experience to the next level. Collagen is fundamental to the beauty of your hair, skin, nail, and joint health, and the addition of biotin and vitamin C amplifies collagen synthesis in the body, magnifying beauty benefits. Its time to express your true radiance, one scoop at a time."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GMP Good Manufacturing Practice"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Non-GMO\r\nPreservative free"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Take 10.4 grams once (1x) daily with 8 fl oz of water or your favorite beverage."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Collagen is not a complete protein. Do not use to replace dietary protein.\r\nWarning: Read entire label prior to use."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of individuals under the age of 18."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is damaged or missing."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Do not use if pregnant, attempting to become pregnant, or nursing. Consult healthcare professional before using this or any other dietary supplement, especially if you have or suspect you may have any medical condition, or if taking any other dietary supplement, prescription, or over-the-counter medications, as combining these products may cause side effects. "},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use and immediately call healthcare professional if you experience an adverse reactions. Do not exceed recommended serving."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Dairy-free\r\nShellfish free\r\nSoy-free\r\nPeanut-free\r\nGluten-free"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Keto friendly"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. Th